      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The inevitability of automation by modern economic standards suggests that some labor displacement is already a given as technology advances. However, the true outcome for society depends far more on proactive policy choices regarding universal basic income and social safety nets. Fostering innovation will only go so far if governments fail to redistribute the resulting benefits equitably. Your angle on policy intervention is a strong one to highlight its critical role amidst technological progress.",
